OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 25 APR
OL,4,G0800FRadcliffe and Maconie
OL,5,     GMark and Stuart present a feast
OL,6,     Gof great music and chat, plus
OL,7,     GSuper Furry Animals' frontman
OL,8,     GGruff Rhys shares his 'First,
OL,9,     GLast and Everything' and chats
OL,10,     Gabout the band's new tour.
